: "(Dikatakan kepada mereka): \"Rasakanlah azabmu itu. Inilah azab yang dulu kamu minta untuk disegerakan\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ذُوقُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِتْنَتَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُنتُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/0624ebb11e4405f4a1f5.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) hasten", "bs": "požurujete", "tr": "acele ediyorsunuz", "fr": "vous vous hâtez", "id": "kalian bergegas", "ur": "تم سب جلدی کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা তাড়াহুড়ো কর", "fa": "شتاب می‌کنید"}}]}, {"ref": "29:54", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3394.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "They bid thee hasten on the doom, when lo! hell verily will encompass the disbelievers", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "(Evet) senden azabı çarçabuk (getirmeni) istiyorlar. Halbuki cehennem, hiç şüpheleri olmasın, kâfirleri kuşatacaktır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تم سے عذاب کی جلدی مچاتے ہیں، اور بیشک جہنم گھیرے ہوئے ہے کافروں کو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka meminta kepadamu supaya segera diturunkan azab. Dan sesungguhnya Jahannam benar-benar meliputi orang-orang yang kafir,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/04990555bdacaa4c048d.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "požuruju te", "en": "they urge you to hasten", "tr": "senden acele etmeni isterler", "fr": "ils te pressent de hâter", "id": "mereka mendesakmu agar bersegera", "ur": "وہ تم سے جلدی مانگتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা তোমার কাছে তাড়াহুড়া করে দাবি করে", "fa": "از تو شتاب می‌خواهند"}}, {"text": "بِٱلْعَذَابِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَإِنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَهَنَّمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَمُحِيطَةٌۢ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "10:50", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1414.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Say: Have ye thought: When His doom cometh unto you as a raid by night, or in the (busy) day; what is there of it that the guilty ones desire to hasten?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "De ki: \"O'nun azabı size geceleyin uykuda veya güpe gündüz gelecek olsa, ne dersiniz? Günahkârların onu alelacele istemeleri için ne sebep vardır?\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تم فرماؤ بھلا بتاؤ تو اگر اس کا عذاب تم پر رات کو آئے یا دن کو تو اس میں وہ کونسی چیز ہے کہ مجرموں کو جس کی جلدی ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Katakanlah: \"Terangkan kepadaku, jika datang kepada kamu sekalian sikaaan-Nya di waktu malam atau di siang hari, apakah orang-orang yang berdosa itu meminta disegerakan juga?\"", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قُلْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَرَءَيْتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَتَىٰكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَذَابُهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَيَٰتًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَهَارًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّاذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَسْتَعْجِلُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a3ae86a9aac27583339b.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it hastens", "bs": "požuruje", "tr": "acele eder", "fr": "il se hâte", "id": "dia bergegas", "ur": "وہ جلدی کرتا ہے", "bn": "সে তাড়াহুড়ো করে", "fa": "شتاب می‌کند"}}, {"text": "مِنْهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ", "count": 6, "first": "6:57", "audio": "audio/72317f2c1bfde3f0a8c2.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) hasten", "bs": "požurujete", "tr": "acele ediyorsunuz", "fr": "vous vous hâtez", "id": "kalian bergegas", "ur": "تم سب جلدی کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা তাড়াহুড়ো কর", "fa": "شتاب می‌کنید"}}, {"arabic": "وَيَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ", "count": 3, "first": "13:6", "audio": "audio/cbbf6eb4da0e6e94cf51.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": ["anta"], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "and they ask you to hasten", "bs": "i požuruju te", "tr": "ve seni acele ettirirler", "fr": "et ils te pressent de hâter", "id": "dan mereka meminta kamu bergegas", "ur": "اور وہ تم سے جلدی کا مطالبہ کرتے ہیں", "bn": "এবং তারা তোমাকে তাড়াহুড়ো করতে বলে", "fa": "و از تو شتاب می‌خواهند"}}, {"arabic": "يَسْتَعْجِلُ", "count": 2, "first": "10:50", "audio": "audio/a3ae86a9aac27583339b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it hastens", "bs": "požuruje", "tr": "acele eder", "fr": "il se hâte", "id": "dia bergegas", "ur": "وہ جلدی کرتا ہے", "bn": "সে তাড়াহুড়ো করে", "fa": "شتاب می‌کند"}}, {"arabic": "يَسْتَعْجِلُونَ", "count": 2, "first": "26:204", "audio": "audio/c1152